"""The thirty Evil archetypes of the Decennial roster (docs/labyrinth/decennial_bosses.md, section "Archetypes").

An archetype is a hand-written kind of boss: what it is, where it may stand (a level range and the halls that suit it), what it looks like (looks of the 22 abyssal looks with a tint and a size), what it pays,
how its fight is built (signature mechanics, abilities by phase, adds) and the words it is described with (bynames, places, three lore lines, the names of its four phases). The generator turns an archetype
and a level into one boss; the same archetype serves three or four levels, each with a different given name, byname, place, hall, look and tint.
"""


